1
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:45,897
Mokku, witches come
out on nights like this.

2
00:02:45,922 --> 00:02:47,784
You must never go outside.

3
00:02:48,369 --> 00:02:49,377
A witch?

4
00:02:49,402 --> 00:02:50,396
That's right.

5
00:02:50,421 --> 00:02:52,397
On full moon nights like this...

6
00:02:52,561 --> 00:02:56,180
...the witch who lives in Devil's
Forest comes out to kidnap children.

7
00:02:57,550 --> 00:02:59,220
What does she do after kidnapping them?

8
00:03:00,005 --> 00:03:02,160
She drinks their blood.

9
00:03:02,574 --> 00:03:03,574
Their blood?

10
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,800
Yes.

11
00:03:12,718 --> 00:03:15,880
That is why children must
not stay out late playing.

12
00:03:16,084 --> 00:03:20,687
That's a lie. It's just a story grownups
made up to stop kids from going out.

13
00:03:21,550 --> 00:03:23,700
It is not made up!

14
00:03:23,950 --> 00:03:26,780
The witch in Devil's Forest is a vampire.

15
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:30,380
Come on now, Mokku, go to sleep.

16
00:03:30,584 --> 00:03:32,000
I'm not sleepy.

17
00:03:32,105 --> 00:03:33,620
You're a good boy, aren't you, Mokku?

18
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:38,660
Keep that up and Grandpa won't help you
if the vampire comes and carries you off.

19
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:41,060
How boring.

20
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:44,175
See? You're sleepy after all.

21
00:03:45,224 --> 00:03:49,980
Boring, so boring. I wish school
didn't exist. I hate school!

22
00:03:51,154 --> 00:03:53,940
Now, now, stop grumbling. Time for bed.

23
00:03:56,081 --> 00:03:57,950
You need to sleep early
so you can go to school.

24
00:03:57,975 --> 00:03:59,765
Otherwise, the witch will come kidnap you!

25
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:03,688
I'm a puppet! Why would she ever kidnap me?

26
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:05,775
That's right.

27
00:04:05,799 --> 00:04:09,767
Grandpa just can't help treating you like
a real human child.

28
00:04:10,041 --> 00:04:11,171
Good night.

29
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:16,450
I want to become a real human, too.

30
00:04:17,733 --> 00:04:18,494
Good morning!

31
00:04:18,596 --> 00:04:19,156
Good morning!

32
00:04:19,226 --> 00:04:20,226
Good morning!

33
00:04:24,161 --> 00:04:26,605
Good morning, Mokku!
Did you do your homework?

34
00:04:27,227 --> 00:04:28,227
Oh no, I forgot!

35
00:04:28,436 --> 00:04:30,268
You'll be made to stand
in the hallway again!

36
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,442
Ah... Me too...

37
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,642
I hate math, too!

38
00:04:35,010 --> 00:04:39,731
Me too. Mama said a witch would
come out last night, so I was terrified...

39
00:04:39,755 --> 00:04:42,584
Me too! I was so scared!

40
00:04:43,624 --> 00:04:46,520
Scaredy-cats. Witches aren't real.

41
00:04:48,022 --> 00:04:50,324
I watched the street all night.

42
00:04:50,637 --> 00:04:53,487
The only person who passed
by was the old lady Koshiki.

43
00:04:54,059 --> 00:04:56,426
But Grandpa said so.

44
00:04:56,559 --> 00:04:58,871
He said witches live in Devil's Forest...

45
00:04:59,411 --> 00:05:00,979
...and vampires, too.

46
00:05:01,397 --> 00:05:02,894
That's just superstition.

47
00:05:02,997 --> 00:05:04,840
I bet you were shivering in bed.

48
00:05:04,958 --> 00:05:06,640
<i>Oh Dear God.</i>

49
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:11,373
I don't believe in witches either.

50
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:14,902
I just thought if I told the teacher that,
he'd forgive me for the homework.

51
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:17,275
Then let's go explore
Devil's Forest right now.

52
00:05:17,746 --> 00:05:20,475
If we go to school, they'll just make
us stand in the hallway anyway.

53
00:05:21,062 --> 00:05:21,887
But...

54
00:05:21,965 --> 00:05:24,648
Mokku's just scared of the witch after all.

55
00:05:24,725 --> 00:05:27,407
Mokku is a chicken!

56
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:30,722
I promised Grandpa I'd
go straight to school!

57
00:05:31,014 --> 00:05:34,490
Fine! We're not playing with
a coward like you anymore!

58
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,703
Let's go!

59
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:36,840
Yeah!

60
00:05:37,707 --> 00:05:38,754
I'll coming too!

61
00:05:54,210 --> 00:05:55,920
Mokku, don't go!

62
00:05:56,364 --> 00:05:57,364
Shut up!

63
00:05:57,635 --> 00:05:59,780
Real courage means going to school!

64
00:06:00,325 --> 00:06:02,940
Mind your own business! I'm not a coward!

65
00:06:03,325 --> 00:06:05,681
If you go to Devil's Forest,
you'll regret it!

66
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,800
Out of my way!

67
00:06:08,409 --> 00:06:10,639
He's completely hopeless...

68
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:20,262
I misjudged you, Mokku.

69
00:06:20,403 --> 00:06:25,040
There's no way witches exist.
Besides, I'm not scared at all!

70
00:06:29,730 --> 00:06:32,057
The foot of that mountain
is Devil's Forest.

71
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:38,140
I'm starting to get scared.

72
00:06:39,128 --> 00:06:41,779
If there's a witch, I'll catch her.

73
00:06:42,006 --> 00:06:44,025
We'll make a fortune
putting her on display.

74
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:49,110
We'll be top-rate showmen.
We'll take the whole world by storm!

75
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,726
Rosanna, what do you want to do?

76
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:52,260
I don't want to go.

77
00:06:52,445 --> 00:06:55,960
Right. We've never come
this far from home before.

78
00:06:56,285 --> 00:06:58,025
Mokku, let's go back.

79
00:06:58,290 --> 00:06:59,828
We came all this way!

80
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:03,780
Suit yourself. But I said no girls allowed!

81
00:07:04,425 --> 00:07:05,192
Let's go.

82
00:07:05,345 --> 00:07:06,134
Yeah.

83
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:10,482
Come on, Mokku. Let's go home.

84
00:07:10,662 --> 00:07:12,119
Everyone is worried.

85
00:07:12,405 --> 00:07:14,958
I'm a boy. I'm not going to be a coward.

86
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:16,248
What's the matter, Mokku?

87
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:18,495
If you're scared, go home with the girls.

88
00:07:18,844 --> 00:07:21,464
Wait! I'm coming! Hey!

89
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,480
Lino, you go in first.

90
00:07:37,592 --> 00:07:39,640
Marco, you go first.

91
00:07:39,665 --> 00:07:42,640
N-No way. Franco's supposed to be first!

92
00:07:44,026 --> 00:07:45,080
Look at you shivering.

93
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:49,740
You're shaking too, Franco!

94
00:07:50,236 --> 00:07:51,766
I'm just trembling with excitement!

95
00:07:52,305 --> 00:07:53,305
I'll go.

96
00:08:06,730 --> 00:08:10,900
No child who ever entered that
cursed forest has survived.

97
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:14,400
May God protect them.

98
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:17,650
All right, move out once you're ready!

99
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:20,380
Wait!

100
00:08:20,895 --> 00:08:21,520
What is it?

101
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,389
What are you doing here?

102
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:25,580
Please, take me with you.

103
00:08:26,165 --> 00:08:29,380
An old fool like you
would only slow us down.

104
00:08:30,075 --> 00:08:33,240
Mokku is my beloved grandchild. Please!

105
00:08:33,615 --> 00:08:35,012
I said no, and that's final.

106
00:08:36,169 --> 00:08:37,321
All right, let's go, everyone.

107
00:08:40,219 --> 00:08:41,697
Take this with you.

108
00:08:41,721 --> 00:08:45,500
Hold the cross high, and thrust it
toward the vampire if she appears!

109
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:56,573
Dear God, please protect Mokku.

110
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:03,151
Franco!

111
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,576
Lino!

112
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:06,799
Wait!

113
00:09:19,569 --> 00:09:20,569
So close!

114
00:09:24,444 --> 00:09:25,476


115
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:39,810
Franco!

116
00:09:39,835 --> 00:09:43,160
Franco! Franco!

117
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:26,543
Help me!

118
00:10:39,654 --> 00:10:40,740
Damn it!

119
00:10:56,725 --> 00:10:57,952
Franco!

120
00:11:02,012 --> 00:11:04,724
You're safe now. Papa is here.

121
00:11:04,748 --> 00:11:07,293
Papa... Papa, I'm sorry.

122
00:11:07,749 --> 00:11:08,913
What happened to Mokku?

123
00:11:11,347 --> 00:11:12,347
Lino!

124
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,560
Marco!

125
00:12:09,939 --> 00:12:11,798
What did you come here for?

126
00:12:12,130 --> 00:12:14,508
A-Are y-you a w-w-witch?

127
00:12:16,859 --> 00:12:18,709
Quite a feisty one, aren't you?

128
00:12:18,733 --> 00:12:21,561
As if there would be
witches in these woods!

129
00:12:38,659 --> 00:12:43,960
Mokku is my only reason for
living. Dear God, please save him.

130
00:12:46,769 --> 00:12:47,769
Old man!

131
00:12:48,339 --> 00:12:51,100
Where's Mokku? What
about Mokku? Is he safe?

132
00:12:53,265 --> 00:12:56,820
No! That can't be! It can't be!

133
00:12:59,055 --> 00:13:02,000
Both Lino and Marco were
eaten alive by wolves.

134
00:13:02,745 --> 00:13:05,200
My boy was the only one who
managed to survive, but...

135
00:13:07,541 --> 00:13:11,144
It was my fault... "Study, study"...

136
00:13:11,168 --> 00:13:15,960
Forcing Mokku when he hated studying
so much... Mokku, please forgive me...

137
00:13:15,985 --> 00:13:18,651
Be naughty, be lazy,
be selfish, it doesn't matter!

138
00:13:18,676 --> 00:13:21,492
Mokku, please just come back to me!

139
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:35,771
Really? No school or church, and we
can just play from morning till night?

140
00:13:37,305 --> 00:13:40,680
That's right. This is a
paradise for lazybones.

141
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:42,720
I love the sound of that!

142
00:13:42,929 --> 00:13:46,620
Climbing trees, catching
birds... I hate studying!

143
00:13:48,430 --> 00:13:49,520
Is that so?

144
00:13:50,324 --> 00:13:52,320
I'm so glad I met you, old woman.

145
00:13:52,610 --> 00:13:55,646
Is that so, is that so?
Mokku is a good boy.

146
00:13:57,406 --> 00:13:59,760
Look over there, see?

147
00:14:06,599 --> 00:14:09,957
Wow, a castle! Can I really live there?

148
00:14:30,289 --> 00:14:32,920
It's pretty, but why are
there only red flowers?

149
00:14:33,335 --> 00:14:37,115
Countess Leonard loves the color of blood.

150
00:14:49,459 --> 00:14:54,073
Hello there! I'm Mokku. What's your name?

151
00:14:58,409 --> 00:15:01,680
These little people can't speak at all.

152
00:15:02,703 --> 00:15:03,703
Come along now.

153
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:15,083
Incredible!

154
00:15:20,859 --> 00:15:23,920
Countess Leonard...

155
00:15:33,279 --> 00:15:35,420
I have returned.

156
00:15:36,195 --> 00:15:38,181
Good work. What is it?

157
00:15:49,949 --> 00:15:51,800
She looks like the Oak Tree Fairy.

158
00:15:52,459 --> 00:15:54,115
The Oak Tree Fairy?

159
00:15:54,595 --> 00:15:56,860
Yeah, she's like a mother to me, but...

160
00:15:57,225 --> 00:15:59,691
The Countess is much prettier.

161
00:15:59,988 --> 00:16:01,230
Oh, thank you.

162
00:16:01,689 --> 00:16:04,779
Then I shall be your mother from now on.

163
00:16:04,803 --> 00:16:07,465
Really? I'd love that!

164
00:16:07,773 --> 00:16:11,300
Of course. I adore children, after all.

165
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:15,821
The other children were wearing
crosses, but the wolves...

166
00:16:16,001 --> 00:16:17,524
Poor things...

167
00:16:17,548 --> 00:16:18,948
Do you mean Franco and the others?

168
00:16:19,325 --> 00:16:22,300
No, just some foolish children.

169
00:16:22,607 --> 00:16:23,941
I'm not foolish!

170
00:16:24,405 --> 00:16:28,815
I know. Come along. Let us go to my room.

171
00:16:35,129 --> 00:16:38,220
He was my husband,
and the lord of this castle.

172
00:16:38,335 --> 00:16:39,971
He's dressed funny.

173
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:43,380
Yes, he passed away a very long time ago.

174
00:16:45,259 --> 00:16:48,960
My family died out 500 years ago.

175
00:16:49,355 --> 00:16:52,265
500 years ago? Then how
old are you, Countess?

176
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:54,802
I am 521 years old.

177
00:16:55,193 --> 00:16:56,207
What?!

178
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,280
521 years old?!

179
00:17:03,350 --> 00:17:07,829
I'm the prince of the castle!
I'm a prince! A prince!

180
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:11,860
I'm a prince! A prince!

181
00:17:28,729 --> 00:17:31,140
Honestly, that Mokku is
completely hopeless.

182
00:17:31,495 --> 00:17:35,272
Grandfather hasn't eaten a thing all
day and has been worrying sick...

183
00:17:57,014 --> 00:17:58,475


184
00:18:49,939 --> 00:18:51,615
He's not a human child.

185
00:19:01,379 --> 00:19:03,020
You are not a human child.

186
00:19:03,634 --> 00:19:05,520
Go sleep with the little people.

187
00:20:06,559 --> 00:20:08,320
Hey, let's play, everyone!

188
00:20:08,709 --> 00:20:10,250
Why are you working so hard?

189
00:20:10,514 --> 00:20:12,900
We're allowed to play from
morning till night here, right?

190
00:20:17,509 --> 00:20:20,780
Oh, I see. You can't speak.

191
00:20:21,615 --> 00:20:22,615
Look, heave-ho!

192
00:20:24,279 --> 00:20:25,460
See? Isn't it fun?

193
00:20:26,329 --> 00:20:28,725
You guys try it too! Come on!

194
00:20:29,215 --> 00:20:30,215
Come on!

195
00:20:30,522 --> 00:20:32,670


196
00:20:37,249 --> 00:20:38,800
Something's strange...

197
00:20:44,859 --> 00:20:47,922
Just when I thought I could finally
suck the blood of a healthy child...

198
00:20:49,047 --> 00:20:53,580
There isn't a single drop of
blood in his body, only water.

199
00:20:54,704 --> 00:20:56,620
I have a good idea.

200
00:21:00,576 --> 00:21:01,600
Mokku!

201
00:21:01,826 --> 00:21:02,826
Yes!

202
00:21:05,249 --> 00:21:06,687
What is it, Mama?

203
00:21:07,295 --> 00:21:09,526
Don't you want some friends?

204
00:21:10,219 --> 00:21:12,962
Yes, I want to be friends
with the little people, too.

205
00:21:13,309 --> 00:21:17,069
The little people won't do.
None of them can speak.

206
00:21:18,457 --> 00:21:21,410
So bring children from the village.

207
00:21:21,606 --> 00:21:25,959
Yes, a cute girl would be nice.
You must have a girlfriend or two.

208
00:21:25,984 --> 00:21:31,139
I sure do! Let's see... Anna, Rosanna,
and Sophia? I'm surprisingly popular.

209
00:21:32,260 --> 00:21:36,107
Bring them all here. And make
sure they take off their crosses.

210
00:21:36,131 --> 00:21:37,221
Why?

211
00:21:37,389 --> 00:21:40,440
You hate school and church
too, don't you, Mokku?

212
00:21:40,894 --> 00:21:43,842
Mama hates kids who go to church, too.

213
00:21:43,928 --> 00:21:45,488
Yeah! I'm on my way!

214
00:21:46,089 --> 00:21:48,780
Good. Make sure you bring them.

215
00:22:16,779 --> 00:22:23,900
Mokku, now wherever you go,
you will obey my every command.

216
00:22:24,484 --> 00:22:25,484
Now, go!

217
00:23:33,013 --> 00:23:37,685
<i>Bewitched and completely
hollowed out inside...</i>

218
00:23:38,147 --> 00:23:42,311
<i>...Mokku obeyed the vampire's
orders and lured his girlfriends
to the castle in th forest.</i>

219
00:23:43,989 --> 00:23:46,760
<i>At last, the long-awaited blood of
healthy children is hers to drink.</i>

220
00:23:47,115 --> 00:23:48,115
<i>The vampire...</i>

221
00:23:48,287 --> 00:23:50,559
<i>...finally reveals her
terrifying true form and...</i>

222
00:23:50,833 --> 00:23:52,882
<i>...prepares to attack the young girls.</i>

223
00:23:54,284 --> 00:23:57,620
<i>What will become of Mokku and his friends?</i>

224
00:23:58,434 --> 00:24:00,900
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku.</i>

